---
import FormattedDate from "../../components/FormattedDate.astro";
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
import Prose from "../../components/Prose.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_TITLE } from "../../consts";

const updatedAt = new Date("2026-10-26");
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
  description="What data this site collects, what I use it for and how you can change your cookie choice."
>
  <main class="content">
    <Prose>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="text-muted">
        Last updated: <FormattedDate date={updatedAt} />
      </p>

      <p>
        This is a personal website. I don't sell or share your data, and I only
        collect the minimum needed to keep the site running and to know whether
        what I write is useful to anyone.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        If you accept cookies, I use Google Analytics 4 to measure visits: which
        pages are read, what kind of device and browser are used, and the
        approximate country or city. To do this, Google stores the
        <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code> cookies in your browser. If you
        reject them, Google Analytics is not loaded.
      </p>

      <h2 id="cookies" class="scroll-mt-8">Your cookie preferences</h2>
      <p>
        Current status: <strong data-consent-status>not chosen yet</strong>. You
        can change it at any time:
      </p>
      <div data-consent-controls class="not-prose flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <button
          type="button"
          data-consent="granted"
          aria-pressed="false"
          class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-gray-400 px-5 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 aria-pressed:border-gray-800 aria-pressed:bg-gray-800 aria-pressed:text-white dark:border-gray-600 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 dark:aria-pressed:border-gray-100 dark:aria-pressed:bg-gray-100 dark:aria-pressed:text-gray-900"
        >
          Accept cookies
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          data-consent="denied"
          aria-pressed="false"
          class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-gray-400 px-5 py-2 hover:bg-gray-100 aria-pressed:border-gray-800 aria-pressed:bg-gray-800 aria-pressed:text-white dark:border-gray-600 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 dark:aria-pressed:border-gray-100 dark:aria-pressed:bg-gray-100 dark:aria-pressed:text-gray-900"
        >
          Reject cookies
        </button>
      </div>

      <h2>Contact form</h2>
      <p>
        If you write to me, I receive your name, email, subject and message. I
        use them only to reply to you. Messages are sent through
        <a href="https://resend.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Resend</a
        >, and to stop spam the form uses
        <a
          href="https://www.cloudflare.com/products/turnstile/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Turnstile</a
        >, which analyzes technical browser signals to verify that you're not a
        bot.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The site is hosted on Vercel, which may log technical data from each
        visit, such as your IP address, for security and operational purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under Uruguay's Personal Data Protection Law No. 18.331, you can ask me
        to access, correct or delete your data by emailing
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
      </p>
    </Prose>
  </main>
</Layout>
